[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到食堂后――"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善闭着眼睛坐在吧台前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“小哥，你又来了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善，你是来实现梦想的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“抱歉，我现在正在集中注意力。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像是比赛前的运动员一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他究竟点了些什么呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔也在天善面前闭上眼睛，静静地等待他点单。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然睁开眼睛！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“看球――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然摆出握拍的姿势挥了起来！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呼！哈！嗬啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“太嫩了！就是这里！别想突破！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这动作比挥拍还要激烈，简直就像是在打乒乓球版的影子拳击。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哼……有两下子嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15093"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不过……我已经看穿你了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嚯！哈！啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么……我、我看到了……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"透过天善，我仿佛看到了一场激烈的比赛！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“吃我这招啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呜啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后输了！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15102"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“唔……打得好，乒乓球……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不甘心地单膝跪地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么连想象中的对手都赢不了呢？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15023"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哈啊哈啊……哈啊哈啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事吧？都是汗啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“在县级预选赛中全力以赴对战的话，大概就会变成这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好歹设定成决赛啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“但是，这样就好……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“老板，拜托了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“好嘞。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到天善的声音，大叔动了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从冰箱里拿出了大杯子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“难道说……是未成年人不能喝但很想喝的那个!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“太天真了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔又从冰箱里拿出了些什么，在吧台上逐个摆放。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是……欧乐C！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“这可是小小的巨人啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善又闭上眼睛，集中起了注意力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕噜噜～……咕噜噜～……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"欧乐C的瓶盖在他面前一个个被打开，一瓶接一瓶地倒进了玻璃杯里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“来吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一杯满满的欧乐C放在天善面前。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……这就是我的梦想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“比赛结束后，尽情地喝欧乐C来忘记一切。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这不就是借酒浇愁吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说，喝德卡维他C之类的不行吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……太狂妄了，鹰原。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“没有什么饮料能超越欧乐C，也没有什么饮料能比它差。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“童年时留在脑海中的回忆是独一无二的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉，虽然听起来很帅气，但完全听不懂你在说什么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“上吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15029"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“咕噜！……咕噜！……咕噜！……咕噜！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦哦……一口气喝掉那么一大杯碳酸饮料！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看你喝得这么满足，我也觉得心满意足了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“……真的是这样吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……不对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“为什么……味道、喉咙的刺激感，明明一切都和想象中的一样……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15023"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“却还是缺少了什么重要的东西……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“还不够吗!؟还是说身体!!还不够渴吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔把一瓶瓶装的欧乐C放在了吧台上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“试试看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……咕……咕……咕!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15026"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“就是这个！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“欧乐C……原来就是要用瓶子喝才对啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“想续杯的话，这里还有很多哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从冰箱里拿出冰镇的欧乐C，打开瓶盖放在吧台上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15029"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我不客气了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i203"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15012"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15012"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"找到了欧乐C真谛的天善，之后痛快地对着瓶子一饮而尽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――眼睛闪烁着如同孩童般纯真的光芒。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――梦想食堂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里是教会人们童年梦想――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以及重要事物的地方。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]